# Keep build contexts lean and never ship local installs / secrets.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
# Credential files that live next to the code on a developer machine.
**/*service-account*.json
**/*firebase-adminsdk*.json
**/play-store-credentials.json
**/.git
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
**/coverage
**/.vscode
**/.idea

# Other services aren't part of the backend image.
fastapi/
frontend/
docs/
Bugs/
scripts/
